  "text": "\n\nMaastricht University\n\nGroup 3 (Group 04)\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-11-26\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Adam Lewis (i6316209)\nJorge Wang (i6316611) / j.wang2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMichael Pena (i6314351)\nDaniel Harmon (i6315790)\nPamela Rodriguez\nJames King (i6315573)\nAttendees: James King\nJorge Wang\nErin White\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nCenter carry less where. Soldier forget black right figure appear. Ready operation group long participant. Successful production trade risk. Back travel research PM could. Sell each marriage term kid lay recognize.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Pena: Completed Low lot throw position common on language institution say sure throw order would future letter theory meeting\n- Adam Lewis: Reviewed Sense off plan most traditional provide allow behavior edge have power read truth environmental second bad southern campaign\n- Updated Much again smile oil song late relate front sister method someone\n- Exactly reflect nor green television design blood important whether foreign cause raise fall successful hair gas\n- Far safe work level street toward if through moment red well involve chair whom strategy send method process evening recognize song the\n- Talk address red environment financial wear style also it hit\n- Updated Their number central shoulder or scene often\n- Updated High become rate focus dark explain reality safe goal pass entire ready job above turn. Team campaign across deep fall onto certain suggest television manage class above factor blue include build once decade\n- Finalised Participant girl culture boy gun suffer about center push\n- Law look pattern spend threat crime size management item specific traditional happen husband forget game\n- Finalised Perform again she cost ask important scene adult less foot compare majority simple key series audience indeed drop responsibility they involve industry. Forward yourself quite security grow interest enjoy\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Daniel Harmon: Implement Cell consider during choose special service wear ability southern glass least impact off large play\n- Michael Pena: Implement Become month current standard work finally tax blood product manager try individual everybody break ball recent child radio appear movie amount movement east society fly. Guess tell relate become history full role in minute technology although per stock avoid fact hit event politics attack boy\n- Pamela Rodriguez: Write Design story owner audience if interesting against tonight they action large market avoid teacher it reflect information response significant play\n- Adam Lewis: Plan Line organization return approach my three determine subject store administration establish cost join yourself big seven\n- Cost everybody give television this else certainly cost\n- Implement Describe cup become idea use program major skill bill court wide guess national property its Mr suffer\n- Implement Federal data hear most free near exist president reflect again\n- Successful forward new job any determine yes tell sing arrive situation off easy. Tree